      "background": null,
      "summary": "Senior IT executive with 29 years of experience in the hospitality industry with a proven track record of successful IT strategies, acquisitions and building IT transition teams and developed critical IT support options to meet timeline and budget targets, while being highly adept at defining, acquiring, implementing and supporting corporate as well as hotel hardware and software.  Extensive experience with ERP, CRM and financial systems with strong communication and organizational skills and strong analytical and problem-solving skills with great attention to detail and the ability to see the big picture.  Thrive in a results-oriented environment where quality, execution and flexibility are valued.  \n\nExpertise: IT Strategy, Emerging Technology Evaluation & Acquisition, WAN LAN configuration.  Router, Firewall, Network Switch implementation.  IT Governance & Service Management, Program Management of Large Transition Initiatives, Strategic Analysis & Internal Consulting, Business Process Re-engineering, Organizational Development & Change Management, Strategic Sourcing/Outsourcing, Vendor Management.  IT Cost Control. DNS Management. Cloud computing. Microsoft 365 Administration."
    },
